  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:zhenjun" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">領軍將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:zhenjun:m0004" ref="ier_lqj_x4q">郗愔</persName>爲鎮軍大將軍</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:sikong" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以鎮軍大將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:sikong:m0006" ref="ier_lqj_x4q">郗愔</persName>爲司空。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">八月戊寅，司空<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin067-xiyin:death:m0007" ref="ier_lqj_x4q">郗愔</persName>薨。</p>
</text>
